{"data": {"uuid": "2f4b842b-6261-402d-ab6d-f49c2770c011", "slug": "yaluk", "name": "Yaluk", "class_name": "QDRV_JUST_S02_Yaluk_SCItem", "classification": "Ship.QuantumDrive", "classification_label": "Quantum Drive", "description": {"en_EN": "The bigger the haul, the harder your quantum drive has to work. With Juno Starwerk's Yaluk onboard, you'll know that you have a quantum drive that is up to the challenge of getting the job done.", "de_DE": "Hersteller: Juno Starwerk\nTyp (En): Quantum Drive\nTyp (De): Quantenantrieb\n\nGr\u00f6\u00dfe: S2\nG\u00fctegrad: D\nKlasse: Industrial (Industrie)\n\nJe gr\u00f6\u00dfer die Beute, desto h\u00e4rter muss dein Quantenantrieb arbeiten. Mit Yaluk von Juno Starwerk an Bord wei\u00dft du, dass du \u00fcber einen Quantenantrieb verf\u00fcgst, der der Herausforderung gewachsen ist, die Aufgabe zu erledigen.", "zh_CN": "\u7269\u54c1\u7c7b\u578b\uff1a\u91cf\u5b50\u9a71\u52a8\u5668\n\u5236\u9020\u5546\uff1a\u6731\u8bfa\u661f\u9645\u5de5\u5382 (Juno Starwerk)\n\u5c3a\u5bf8\uff1a2\n\u7b49\u7ea7\uff1aD\n\u5206\u7c7b\uff1a\u5de5\u4e1a\n\n\u8d27\u8239\u7684\u8fd0\u91cf\u8d8a\u5927\uff0c\u60a8\u91cf\u5b50\u9a71\u52a8\u5668\u7684\u4efb\u52a1\u4e5f\u5c31\u8d8a\u8270\u5de8\u3002\u642d\u8f7d\u6731\u8bfa\u661f\u9645\u5de5\u5382\u7684\"\u4e9a\u9c81\u514b\"\uff0c\u4f60\u4fbf\u80fd\u6df1\u523b\u4f53\u4f1a\u5230\u4e00\u4e2a\u4f18\u79c0\u7684\u91cf\u5b50\u9a71\u52a8\u5668\u662f\u5982\u4f55\u9ad8\u6548\u7387\u5b8c\u6210\u4efb\u52a1\u7684\u6311\u6218\u3002", "fr_FR": "Type d'article : Propulseur quantique\nFabricant : Juno Starwerk\nTaille : 2\nQualit\u00e9 : D\nClasse : Industriel\n\nPlus la collecte de ressources est importante, plus votre propulseur quantique doit travailler dur. Avec le Yaluk de Juno Starwerk \u00e0 bord, vous saurez que vous avez un propulseur quantique capable de relever le d\u00e9fi pour mener \u00e0 bien la t\u00e2che."}, "size": 2, "mass": 840, "event_source": [], "is_base_variant": true, "is_craftable": true, "is_lootable":